    "description": "Propose a split of D4b into four revisions\n\nD4b is too large for one PR. This change adds a proposed split to its entry in TICKETS.md: four revisions, R1 to R4.\n\n- R1: benchmark cases from Martian and ReviewBench. No new tooling.\n- R2: own-repo cases with pooled goldens. Adds the pool tooling.\n- R3: dismissed findings from records become goldens. Depends on R2.\n- R4: bug-injection cases. Independent of R2 and R3.\n\nThe split is a recommendation. The agent that runs D4b can choose a different one.\n\nOnly TICKETS.md changes, so the version does not change.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01XrBTZfAh69BLY1HnoCvN6F\n",
